# STORY-034. Without this file every `COPY server ./server` sent the whole
# working tree to the build: host node_modules (compiled for macOS, not the
# Linux image), the client's dist, git history, and any .env lying around —
# which would have baked a developer's secrets into an image layer, where
# deleting them in a later layer does not remove them.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.env
**/.env.*
!.env.example
.git
.github
**/*.log
**/.DS_Store
client/scripts
